title: I Know God Loves Me
author: Anonymous
composer: Old European Melody
sp_category: "17"
topic: Christ’s Love and Sympathy
notes: "AUTO: chorus detected heuristically — verify"
---

[verse 1]
I know God loves me,
He came to save me,
I know God loves me,
For He is love.

[chorus]
And this my song shall be:
I know God loves me,
I know God loves me,
For He is love.

[verse 2]
I was in bondage
Of sin and darkness
I was in bondage
By sin enslaved.

[chorus]
And this my song shall be:
I know God loves me,
I know God loves me,
For He is love.

[verse 3]
He sent me Jesus
The loving Saviour,
He sent me Jesus
Who set me free.

[chorus]
And this my song shall be:
I know God loves me,
I know God loves me,
For He is love.

[verse 4]
Now I will praise Thee
Thou Love Eternal,
Yes I will praise Thee
While life shall last.

[chorus]
And this my song shall be:
I know God loves me,
I know God loves me,
For He is love.
